[[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3025631\">5580T30</a> (left side only)</p><p>1. Open the rear light cluster access flap.</p><p>2. Disconnect the electrical connections.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Left. rear( light cluster on fixed part)</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024075\">F30</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Right. rear light cluster (fixed part)</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024077\">F31</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Unscrew the nuts.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2005004.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<p>1. Remove the tail-light.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2005005.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the light cluster\nis not damaged.</p><p>Position the tail-light and secure with\nthe nuts.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection</p><p>Close the rear light cluster access flap.</p><p>Check the operation of the rear light cluster\nlights.</p><p><a href=\"#/3025631\">5580T30</a> (left\nside only)</p>"]]